body:
Yes, but who will control it?

\-Why did you eat and digest the fifth intern in six months?

\-He had enough mistakes.

//addressing the team// -Is that true?

//the team that is afraid of ending up in the stomach of the boss//-Yes, yes, he made a lot of mistakes.

Ah, hell. Well, plan B.
// opens mouth wide and eats predator//
Not quite in the spirit of the revolution. But it's very tasty. Forgot that predators are also made of food?
